# Org repos must ship CI

Before `gh repo create li-langverse/...` or promoting a package:

1. Run `python3 scripts/ensure-org-repo-ci.py` (benchmarks) — must exit 0
2. Official packages: `lic/scripts/ensure-package-ci.sh` + `check-traceability.sh`
3. Apply branch protection with required check `check` (packages) or repo-specific job

Do not merge PRs that remove `.github/workflows/ci.yml`.

See [repo-ci-required.md](../../docs/ecosystem/repo-ci-required.md).
